 "scope": "Five exact named integer declarations, not a decoder lower bound or proof of folded-code/Curve25519 applicability, actual base cardinality/support, full algorithmic failure, geometry or attack exponent. Local gate checks source/kernel binding; independently signed standing remains open.",
 "statement": "Core Nat support budget: full-block matches a*m<=T, s<=m, tail r<m, B=m*N+r and N<a*(s+1) imply B<T*(T+1). For T6,B>=42 the floor predicate is incompatible. Standard dimension/root guards with degree offset h>=2 imply that floor predicate; hence those explicit certificate guards cannot both hold under the six-position budget at B>=42. Declared213156431*20633 is numerically at least42."
